id: incorporeal-lock
name: Incorporeal Shaken Off
kind: conditions
# Not a Combat Condition: the Incorporeal State's (2) - read as it is entered (chat.mjs incorporealLocked).
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  The Incorporeal State left by Damage: not entered again till the end of your next turn.
text: >
  Incorporeal State (2): If you exit the Incorporeal state through this effect, you may not enter it again until the end of your next turn.

---

[passive]
